mw2coop patch for maps/contingency.gsc (Contingency, Modern Warfare 2, 64-bit Steam build). Generated by
tools/gen_seek_patches.py; do not edit by hand.

1. Enemies sent at "the player" go for the closest player still up
   (maps\_mw2coop::seek_player; player 1 outside co-op).
@@@ subst magic_break_stealth
enemies[0].favoriteenemy = level.player
@@@ to
enemies[0].favoriteenemy = maps\_mw2coop::seek_player( enemies[0].origin )
@@@ end
@@@ subst setup_stealth_enemy_cleanup
