@@@ to
self.favoriteenemy = maps\_mw2coop::seek_player( self.origin )
@@@ end

2. The allies' catch-up sprint (friendly_adjust_movement_speed / friendly_should_speed_up) runs only when the host cannot see the ally; with the host ahead and the client trailing the
   allies sprinted past the client's eyes (an owner's report). Now no player may see them (maps\_mw2coop::any_player_sees).
@@@ subst friendly_should_speed_up
within_fov( level.player.origin, level.player getPlayerAngles(), self.origin, level.cosine[ "70" ] )
@@@ to
maps\_mw2coop::any_player_sees( self, level.cosine[ "70" ] )
@@@ end

3. The Predator laptop (remote_missile_detonator): the level gives it to level.player only: the weapon, the d-pad slot
   (SetActionSlot), has_remote_detonator, and the thread that raises the laptop, runs the drone and puts it away
   (maps\_remotemissile::RemoteMissileDetonatorNotify). Player 2 only got a copy of the weapon from the loadout sync, with
   none of that: with the laptop out he could neither use it nor switch to another weapon (testers, 2026-11-06; the same
   bug as in Wolverines!). Player 2 gets the same in the three places the level hands it out.
@@@ subst main
level.player thread maps\_remotemissile::RemoteMissileDetonatorNotify();
@@@ to
level.player thread maps\_remotemissile::RemoteMissileDetonatorNotify();
	if ( maps\_mw2coop::is_campaign_coop() && isdefined( level.player2 ) )
	{
		level.player2.remotemissile_actionslot = 4;
		level.player2 thread maps\_remotemissile::RemoteMissileDetonatorNotify();
	}
@@@ end
@@@ subst first_uav_sequence
level.player SetActionSlot( 4, "weapon", "remote_missile_detonator" );
@@@ to
level.player SetActionSlot( 4, "weapon", "remote_missile_detonator" );
		if ( maps\_mw2coop::is_campaign_coop() && isdefined( level.player2 ) )
		{
			level.player2.has_remote_detonator = true;
			level.player2 giveWeapon( "remote_missile_detonator" );
			level.player2 SetActionSlot( 4, "weapon", "remote_missile_detonator" );
		}
@@@ end
@@@ subst spawn_second_uav
level.player SetActionSlot( 4, "weapon", "remote_missile_detonator" );
@@@ to
level.player SetActionSlot( 4, "weapon", "remote_missile_detonator" );
		if ( maps\_mw2coop::is_campaign_coop() && isdefined( level.player2 ) )
		{
			level.player2 giveWeapon( "remote_missile_detonator" );
			level.player2 SetActionSlot( 4, "weapon", "remote_missile_detonator" );
		}
@@@ end

4. Stealth: both players get the level's stealth visibility (stance, movement, shadow): stealth_plugin_basic made it for
   level.player only, so the enemies saw player 2 from far away (testers: "detected from a great distance"). Not run in
   the game yet.
@@@ subst main
level.player stealth_plugin_basic();
@@@ to
foreach ( mw2coop_player in level.players )
		mw2coop_player stealth_plugin_basic();
@@@ end
